  "job_B3.2.17_20251003_114616": {
    "chunk_text": "itende; Drihtnes wuldor \u00feonne, & his rice \u00de\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t ece leoht buton \u00feeostrum, \u00fe\u00e6r is geogo\u00fe buton ylde, \u00fe\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00feele lif buton geendunge, Ne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r hungor, ne \u00feurst, ne wind, ne gewenn, ne w\u00e6tres sweg, ne \u00fe\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 leofra gedal, ne la\u00fera Ac \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe seo ece r\u00e6ste, & haligra symbelnes \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feurhwuna\u00fe. \u00de\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t unasecggenlice rice \u00fee God syle\u00fe eallum \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee hine lufian willa\u00fe. Lufian we hine \u00feonne mid eallre ure heortan megolnesse, \u00feonne lufa\u00fe he us on heofenum mid eallum A to widan feore sy urum Drihtne lof, & wuldor, & weor\u00femynd, abuton ende, on ecnesse; Amen..",
